"Chrome: F12 &rarr; <code>copy(localStorage.userToken)</code>, paste here. "
"Quotes and {\"value\":...} wrappers are stripped automatically. Leave empty to keep the current token."
msgstr "Chrome 里按 F12 → <code>copy(localStorage.userToken)</code>，粘到这里。自动去掉引号和 {\"value\":...} 外壳；留空则保持当前令牌不变。"

