msgid "--pace = seconds between API calls (default 5). --pause = seconds to wait before each duet turn (default 2). Raise both when DeepSeek answers "too frequent"."
msgstr "--pace = 两次 API 请求的间隔秒数（默认 5）；--pause = 自我对话每轮之前的额外停顿秒数（默认 2）。遇到“发送过于频繁”就把两个都调大。"

msgid "Long code in batches"
msgstr "长代码分批输出"

msgid "--batch = max lines per batch (default 200). The model delivers PART 1/N, then the client asks for the next part automatically."
msgstr "--batch = 每批最多行数（默认 200）。模型输出 PART 1/N，客户端会自动索要后续批次。"

msgid "Pause between duet turns (seconds)"
msgstr "自我对话轮次间停顿（秒）"

msgid "Extra wait before each turn of the self-dialogue (default 2). Raise it together with --pace when DeepSeek complains about frequency."
msgstr "每轮自我对话前的额外等待（默认 2 秒）。遇到限流时和 --pace 一起调大。"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Token"
msgstr "令牌"

msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "启动"

msgid "selected press ctrl+c"
msgstr "已选中，请按 Ctrl+C"

msgid "Batching is per complete file, not per N lines: the model delivers PART 1/N with whole files and the client asks for the next part automatically. --batch only sets a soft line hint (default 200); a single file is never cut into pieces."
msgstr "分批以“完整文件”为单位，不按行数切文件：模型给出 PART 1/N（整文件），客户端自动索要下一批；--batch 只是行数提示（默认 200），单个文件不会被切成几段。"

